# AWS Lambda bundle — shared deps + boto3. Compiled to
# requirements-aws.txt. The infra/aws/modules/core/lambda.tf
# `null_resource.lambda_build` reads this file (via var.lambda_requirements
# in that module, which defaults to "requirements-aws.txt"); the
# release + terraform-apply-dev workflows pass LAMBDA_REQUIREMENTS_FILE
# when they need to deviate.
-r requirements.in

boto3
